  _descriptionText: 'Playful painting game for children with childish characters
    and multiple game modes to choose from.

    

    - Pick a childish character,
    paint it however you like and place it alongside others to make an empty ambient
    painting come to life.'
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: 'Complex UI functionality: Multiple image gallery menus, carousels, infinite
      scroll view that smoothly enlarges the element at the center of the screen,
      etc.'
  - Name: 
    Text: Multiple game modes which utilize 2D painting functionality
  - Name: 
    Text: In-Editor tools for playable element setup for each individual game mode
      which increased iteration speed by far
  - Name: 
    Text: Utilized addressables package for memory load optimization
